- Verified from the same board guide that the external debugger connector `U6` follows the ARM standard 10-pin JTAG pinout and can use either `JTAG` or `SWD` if supported by the external adapter, but the board guide does not document a dedicated parallel trace connector or any onboard ICDI support for SWO/SWV/ETM trace capture.
- Decision for path selection: the MCU has trace blocks, but the onboard LaunchPad debugger path documented in the board guide does not provide documented ITM/SWV or ETM/TPIU trace capability; full trace would require a separate trace-capable external probe and board routing not documented as part of the onboard ICDI path.